column37:
Required vehcicle equipment includes leg and engine protection bars, line-cutting device fixed to the handlebars, rear and side metal bars;
Driver must be at least twenty-ne years of age;
CTB Art. 329  Drivers operating the service must present in advance, a negative certificate of criminal distribution record relating to the crimes of homicide, robbery, rape, and corruption of minors, renewable every five years;

An aggregator shall not onboard vehicles which have been registered for more than a period of eight years from the date of initial registration of the vehicle;
Driver must have a valid bank account under their name;
Driver undergoes a medical fitness and eye examination, and a psychological analysis conducted by the aggregator; 
The driver has not been convited within the past 3 years for any of the following offences: DUI, fraus, sexual offences, use of a motor vehicle to commit a cognizable offernce, a crime involving property damage or theft,a cts of violence, acts of terror or acts constituing nuisance or danger to public.
